{"title":"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are on the same side of\nline <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> in the plane. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> units away\nfrom <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/c/7ecaef34c0742a94ad16e0b32f1bfe7f600f9fbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L, B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"34\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> units away from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />.\nThe distance between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. For\nall points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> what is the smallest\nvalue of the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/759e8260c152574a255c9a77de23808f9e0910ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP + PB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"78\" height=\"14\" /> of the distances\nfrom <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />&#160;?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/8/8a89f13972854e2b6a4fc3db792360dd50812d19.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((-1,0)--(16,0),arrow=Arrow()); draw((16,0)--(-1,0),arrow=Arrow()); draw((2,0)--(2,5)--(2+sqrt(128),9)--(2+sqrt(128),0),black); draw((2,5)--(8,0)--(2+sqrt(128),9),dashed); dot((2,5));dot((8,0));dot((2+sqrt(128),9)); MP(&quot;A&quot;,(2,5),W);MP(&quot;P&quot;,(8,0),S);MP(&quot;B&quot;,(2+sqrt(128),9),E);MP(&quot;L&quot;,(14,0),S); MP(&quot;5&quot;,(2,2.5),W);MP(&quot;12&quot;,(2+sqrt(128)/2,7),N);MP(&quot;9&quot;,(2+sqrt(128),4.5),E); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"162\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Construct <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/7/4c71f19552a05ee5e2b31e94aff3fb986884bf31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B&#39;$\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, the reflection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> across <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />, the foot of the perpendicular from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to the segment connecting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. By Pythagorean Theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/7/0f7998647687a5258905bc3ce8ba88bc667c0008.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AQ^2=AB^2-QB^2=12^2-4^2=128$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"293\" height=\"18\" />. The minimum possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/3/ea3ed7b88abb848b6658abc72d64285a4c58b2b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP+BP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" /> is equal to the minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502c26dbb4dd3f0b1703b9f7d873f6d342eb8c06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP+B&#39;P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" />, which is equal to the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/b/2eb2c7600634636b0a25b56d087d112d6fbae523.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB&#39;$\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />. By Pythagorean Theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/3/113b442a238ae8477b8aa84bce20e977daf686ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB&#39;=\\sqrt{AQ^2+B&#39;Q^2}=\\sqrt{128+14^2}=\\boxed{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"342\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II\">2008 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Colorado_Math_Contest\" title=\"University of Northern Colorado Math Contest\"> All UNCO Math Contest Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017215814\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 213/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1407/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 94/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5798/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.707      1 Template:UNCO_Math_Contest_box\n100.00%    7.707      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13597:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017215814 and revision id 93316. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}